Columns: tier ops variant case instruction_rows eligible_nonempty_String_rows eligible_source_bytes output_bytes output_capacity System_requests System_requested_bytes.
This scopes logical work and allocator requests, not wall-clock latency, RSS or GET count. Requested bytes include new sizes on successful reallocations.
